  "MIFARE Classic": "MIFARE Classic",
  "写块0(UID)仅支持可改UID的魔法卡:\n  CUID (Gen3/Gen4)、UID/FUID/UFUID (Gen1A)\n标准 MIFARE Classic 卡无法写块0,写卡时若未检测到上述类型会自动取消勾选并跳过块0。": "Block0 (UID) write only supports UID-changeable magic cards:\n  CUID (Gen3/Gen4), UID/FUID/UFUID (Gen1A)\nStandard MIFARE Classic cards cannot write block0; if not detected, it is auto-unchecked and block0 skipped during write.",
  "检测到该卡为[{card_gen}],支持写块0(UID)。\n\n⚠️ 写入块0为不可逆操作!\n• FUID 卡块0写入后永久锁定!\n• UID/UFUID/CUID 卡可反复写入。\n\n确认继续?": "Detected card: [{card_gen}], supports writing block0 (UID).\n\nWARNING: Writing block0 is IRREVERSIBLE!\n  - FUID: block0 permanently locked after write!\n  - UID/UFUID/CUID: block0 can be rewritten.\n\nContinue?",
  "检测到该卡为[{card_gen}],不支持写块0(UID)。\n\n已自动取消勾选\"写入块0(UID)\",本次写卡将跳过块0。\n\n仅 CUID(Gen3/Gen4)、UID/FUID/UFUID(Gen1A) 支持写块0。": "Detected card: [{card_gen}], does NOT support writing block0 (UID).\n\n\"Write block0 (UID)\" has been auto-unchecked; block0 will be skipped.\n\nOnly CUID (Gen3/Gen4) and UID/FUID/UFUID (Gen1A) support writing block0.",
  "检测到该卡为[{card_gen}],自动判定不支持写块0。\n\n但如果这是 CUID/UID/FUID 魔法卡(检测可能不准),你可以选择\"强制写入块0\"。\n\n• 选\"Yes\"强制写入(已知是CUID/UID卡时)\n• 选\"No\"跳过块0(保守做法,推荐)\n\n⚠️ 标准卡强制写入块0会失败(不会损坏卡),可放心尝试。": "Card detected as [{card_gen}], auto-determined as NOT supporting block 0 write.\n\nHowever, if this is a CUID/UID/FUID magic card (detection may be inaccurate), you can choose to force-write block 0.\n\n• Yes = Force write (when you know it is a CUID/UID card)\n• No = Skip block 0 (conservative, recommended)\n\nNote: Forcing block 0 write on a standard card will simply fail (no damage), safe to try."
